<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: uplifting -->
  <WNA_Uplifting.label>升变</WNA_Uplifting.label>
  <!-- EN: A rite that reshapes a being into a higher form of existence. Beasts, plants, entities and mechanoids are raised to humanity; humans are raised to humanoids; humanoids are raised to whelingnorthans. -->
  <WNA_Uplifting.description>一种将存在重塑为更高形式的仪式。野兽、植物、异象实体与机械体将被提升为人类；人类将被提升为威灵人形；威灵人形将被提升为威灵诺德人。</WNA_Uplifting.description>

</LanguageData>
